{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10130100","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10130100","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1013010001:1":{"text":"失礼了，请允许我再次感谢诸位的鼎力协助。","source_cn":"失礼了，请允许我再次感谢诸位的鼎力协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DCE254BE07B008C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1013010002:2":{"text":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的<style=\"highlight\">圣堂骑士们！</style>","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1013010002":{"text":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的<style=\"highlight\">圣堂骑士们！</style>","source_cn":"我们只是尽力而为，真正的英雄是你们——大驾光临的圣堂骑士们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79F5DEC7C9FB180C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013010003:2":{"text":"只是想说说看嘛。","source_cn":"只是想说说看嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FE6254063282267","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013010005:1":{"text":"艾雅在上，我是隶属圣堂的圣骑士，目前带领一个小队途径圣石镇。","source_cn":"艾雅在上，我是隶属圣堂的圣骑士，目前带领一个小队途径圣石镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA644C8D4048F995E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013010006:1":{"text":"我是副队卢修斯，我们抵达圣石镇不久，恰好碰上魔偶来袭……","source_cn":"我是副队卢修斯，我们抵达圣石镇不久，恰好碰上魔偶来袭……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FF18FE2C6B6B6C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013010007:1":{"text":"请允许我告知各位，如今被称为“魔偶”的怪物——","source_cn":"请允许我告知各位，如今被称为“魔偶”的怪物——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x576470A5CBDC82F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013010008:1":{"text":"与女神和圣堂有关，阻止它们为祸人间，也是我们的责任所在。","source_cn":"与女神和圣堂有关，阻止它们为祸人间，也是我们的责任所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C741990EB4FB282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1013010009:1":{"text":"“善意之路，通往深渊。”你们的女神，当初就不能少慈爱一点吗？","source_cn":"“善意之路，通往深渊。”你们的女神，当初就不能少慈爱一点吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5AE17E7B36B549E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1013010010:2":{"text":"……你不够虔信，这并不是我的损失。","source_cn":"……你不够虔信，这并不是我的损失。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x931EAC984EA78ECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0